{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序，從初盡第六門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所咸反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "子小反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "胡德反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所姧反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勅玉反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舘音"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古斬反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下斬反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無運反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云法密部。經云覆隱法藏，即密義。或云法藏，亦密義。即四分\n律也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受者，執也。此部\n三世有實體。一切性者，三性之中，悉得受戒。即十誦律也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五分律"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此之六界，\n並說為空，云不作相也。彌沙塞者，此云不著有無觀。即五分律也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解脫律。此有戒本"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "外道執有實義，受用塵境為受者。轉諸煩惱者，轉猶捨也。故以舉喻，猶如死屍。此名重空觀，則解脫律。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此律本未至，此\n依大集分別也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解云：婆蹉者，此翻為犢；富羅，此云子，正是犢子部也。此部計我，非是即蘊，亦不離蘊\n而有實我。梵云婆羅畢栗吒託那，新譯云愚異生，舊譯為小兒。准此，經中應言猶如愚異生。以其異生計有實\n我，指此為喻。經云小兒，即愚義。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為立反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以灼反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "居筠反大"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "𢍉連反也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此句收第一德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此句收第七德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此句收第四、五、六、八德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此句收第三句"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後兩白收第二德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "皆捨本姓，同稱釋子沙門也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "入無餘涅槃而無增減"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂四念處乃至八聖道分諸助道法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阿羅漢向乃至須陀洹等住此法中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是為八。此法八句，一一合上喻八句"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "皮必反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "草盜也反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "田結\n反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "力鼎反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音靈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古礙反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "居致反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以證反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "尼展反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畢綿反又步彌反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "盜風"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "之六反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "律文直爾。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "呵割反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鈔取此文證前四分五錢為𠃔釋時竟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂能犯人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "村落\n有四：一、四周垣墻，二、柵籬，三、籬墻不周，四、周周有屋也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即村外靜地。處者，地中一\n切處所也，謂盜犯處也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "主不捨也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "賊心取也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以王立法，若取五錢，若直五錢物，罪應至死。佛隨王\n法，盜滿制重也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "王得自在，不屬於〔也〕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "種種大凡輔佐王者也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所治法者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明罪結也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明治殯法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "博末\n反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能煞之人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明自煞業也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所煞境也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明自他煞業，分二：初、舉煞業；二、結前。初三：初、持刀與人，即安煞具；二、歎他\n譽死，即口讚煞；三、勸死者，勸他令死歎也；二、作是□□，結前三□也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能犯人也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明境虗也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "注云：於〔於〕中分二：初、自稱言者，\n總舉聖法；二、我已入居下，列舉聖法言。又聖智者，謂得生空之智，故言聖智。會正名聖，由觀無我，感於聖故。勝\n法者，謂得法空，解達陰等知無，故曰勝法。我知是，我見是，重結前二句也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X43n0737_p0036a13"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X39n0709_p0449c18"}
